 take:"Art 32 = Supreme Court writs for Fundamental Rights; Art 226 = High Court writs (wider).",
 why:"Article 32 lets a person move the Supreme Court directly to enforce Fundamental Rights; Dr Ambedkar called it the 'heart and soul' of the Constitution. Article 226 gives High Courts writ powers that are wider, covering other legal rights too.",
