 take:"President appoints the CEC and ECs, on a PM-led selection committee's recommendation.",
 why:"The President appoints the CEC and Election Commissioners (Article 324). Under a 2023 law, this is on the recommendation of a selection committee of the Prime Minister, the Leader of the Opposition in the Lok Sabha, and a Union Cabinet Minister nominated by the PM. As of Oct 2026, challenges to this law have been referred to a five-judge Constitution Bench of the Supreme Court.",
